+## Copy-on-write references in generic code
+
+Cow of str, a slice, a fixed array or a path implements the usual AsRef and
+Borrow interfaces in generic code. Asking it for the borrowed payload type
+reads that payload for either variant; borrowing the Cow as itself gives
+the Cow. Its AsRef does not turn borrowed data into owned data. See
+[ADR 0319](../../decisions/0319-cows.md) and #1481.
